  "skills_applied": [],
  "rationale": "Plan follows task specification: 25% test holdout, paid_amount at 95th percentile as target, logistic regression plus gradient_boosting (tree-based) for two models. Features exclude identifiers and target-derived fields, including clinical/operational and financial predictors available at claim submission. Threshold and preprocessing fit on training data only to prevent leakage. Caveats acknowledge class imbalance (top 5% positive rate) and general model limitations."
